00:15:08.812 --> 00:15:10.039
What did you learn from this?

00:15:10.039 --> 00:15:11.035
What are you going to change

00:15:11.035 --> 00:15:12.352
as a result of watching this video?

00:15:12.352 --> 00:15:14.521
Leave in the comments and
I'll join in the discussion.

00:15:14.521 --> 00:15:15.745
I also want to give a quick

00:15:15.745 --> 00:15:17.914
shout out to Cassandra L. DeLuca.

00:15:17.914 --> 00:15:19.692
Cassandra, thank you so
much for buying my book.

00:15:19.692 --> 00:15:20.885
Really means a lot to me.

00:15:20.885 --> 00:15:22.145
Those of you watching

00:15:22.145 --> 00:15:24.014
and you want a chance at a
